   "fen": "2r1r1k1/pp1bppbp/2np2p1/q6n/2P1P3/1NN1BP2/PP1Q2P1/1K1R1B1R b - - 1 14",
   "line": [
    "Nb3"
   ],
   "spoken": "A wrinkle: kicking the advanced knight with g4 runs into a nasty leap to g3, hitting the rook and eyeing the bishop. So prepare slowly and attack fast — drop the knight back to b3 instead, easing the central tension, forcing the queen to declare itself, and untying the hands for a single-minded kingside assault.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 26,
   "t": 309,
   "fen": "2r1r1k1/pp1bppbp/2np2p1/q6n/2PNP3/2N1BP2/PP1Q2P1/1K1R1B1R w - - 0 14",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 27,
   "t": 315,
   "fen": "2r1r1k1/pp1bppbp/2np2p1/q6n/2P1P3/1NN1BP2/PP1Q2P1/1K1R1B1R b - - 1 14",
