   "line": [
    "Rdxf1"
   ],
   "spoken": "Recall the true objective — not to win material, but to be rid of that knight so the queen is finally free to swing to the h-file and mate. And the queenside remains completely intact, so this side of the attack is miles ahead of anything the opponent has managed.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 34,
   "t": 426,
   "fen": "2r1r1k1/pp1bppbp/2npq1p1/8/2P1PBP1/1NN2P2/PP1Q4/1K3R1R w - - 1 18",
