   "fen": "2r1r1k1/pp1bppbp/2npq1p1/8/2P1PBP1/1NN2P2/PP5Q/1K3R1R b - - 2 18",
   "line": [
    "Qh2"
   ],
   "spoken": "The queen arrives on h2, and the capture on h7 sets up mate within a couple of moves. The defence can wriggle, but with so many pieces trained on the king it's just a matter of technique — and the enemy queen is marooned uselessly in the centre.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
